menu "ModESP Scenario Engine"

    config MODESP_SCENARIO_ENABLE
        bool "Enable scenario engine (recipes / .modr runtime)"
        default y
        help
            Master switch for the modesp_scenario component (track-based
            time-dependent algorithm runtime). When disabled, the component
            compiles empty (zero sources), main.cpp skips the engine wiring
            and the /api/scenario/* HTTP endpoints are not registered.

            Products without recipe modules can disable this for a smaller
            binary.

endmenu
